              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મેચ — mec — \"match\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગઈકાલે અમારી શાળાની મેચ હતી. — gaīkāle amārī śāḷānī mec hatī — \"Yesterday our school had a match.\""
