            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હરાવવું — harāvvũ — \"to defeat, to beat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "અમે તેમને મેચમાં હરાવ્યા. — ame temne mecmā̃ harāvyā — \"We beat them in the match.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The causative of હારવું, hārvũ, \"to lose\": to make someone lose."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "હરાવવું (harāvvũ) is built on the taught hārvũ, \"to lose\", with the causative -āv-. CDIAL derives hārvũ from Sanskrit hārayati, \"has taken from oneself, loses\" (CDIAL 14061)."
            }
          ]
        },
